<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - W.R. Grace cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - W.R. Grace cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said it downgraded W.R. Grace &amp; Co to hold from buy due to valuation.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- W.R. Grace gained 4/16 to 59-7/16.</p>
</text>
